[{"id":"4f5e359","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"12db5d6","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"0a24dc3","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-abdel-achkouk-2861018-22717119-600x810.jpg'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-abdel-achkouk-2861018-22717119-1536x1024.jpg' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/pexels-abdel-achkouk-2861018-22717119-scaled.jpg' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Discover Northern Morocco</div><span class='et-eye'>North & imperial cities · 6 days</span><h1>Discover Northern Morocco</h1><p class='lead'>Explore Morocco’s imperial cities, stunning landscapes, and cultural highlights across 6 unforgettable days.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Discover%20Northern%20Morocco%20(6%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>6 days</b><span>5 nights</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Casablanca</span><span>Rabat</span><span>Tangier</span><span>Chefchaouen</span><span>Fes</span><span>Volubilis</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Pick up from Casablanca airport</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Pick up from Casablanca Airport. Start your day with a guide visiting the famous Hassan II Mosque, the largest religious building in the world open for non-Muslims during Fridays. Explore the Souk in the old medina, Bab Marrakech gate, charming hotels, United Nations square, the corniche in Ain Diab, and Morocco Mall.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Casablanca · Rabat · Tangier</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>After breakfast, depart to Rabat. Explore the city with a local guide visiting Almohad northern walls of the Oudaya Kasbah, Hassan Tower, and the King’s Palace. Then drive straight to Tangier, the gateway between Europe and Africa.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Visit of Tangier · Chefchaouen</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Explore Tangier’s Medina, Socco market, and American museum. Visit Cap Spartel for ocean views where Atlantic meets Mediterranean, then the Caves of Hercules. Drive to Chefchaouen through Rif mountains. Overnight in Chefchaouen.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>4</span><small>Day 4</small><b>Explore Chefchaouen · Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Guided tour of Chefchaouen: Utta Hammam Square, Kasbah & Museum, Ras El-Ma Spring. Then drive to Fes with lunch stop on the way if desired. Overnight in Fes.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>5</span><small>Day 5</small><b>Explore the city of Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Visit Marinid Tombs, Musee des Armes, Bab Boujeloud (Blue Gate), Fez El-Bali, Rue Talaa Kebira, Karaouiyine Mosque, Zaouia Moulay Idriss II, Chrabliyine Mosque, souks, Fondouk El Najjarine, Musee Dar El-Batha, Bab Ftouh, Fez El Jedid, Medersa Bou Inania, University of Al-Qarawiyyin, Medersa el Attarin. Overnight in Fes.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>6</span><small>Day 6</small><b>Fes · Volubilis · Casablanca</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>After breakfast, drive 2 hours outside Fes to explore the Roman ruins of Volubilis. Discover mosaics, columns, the basilica, triumphal arch, and Roman city structures. Then drive straight back to Casablanca. End of the tour.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Every itinerary can be adapted — start date, number of days, hotels and stops. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>6 days / 5 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>North & imperial cities</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.m